{"id":"vod_sn_36976","vodId":"36976","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"电波教师","name_cn":"电波教师","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/82fae2222eb9eb3d3618fc7bb288e9cf.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《电波教师》改编自日本漫画家东毅原作的同名漫画。作品此前已有过跨媒体化，曾于2012年和2013年两度动画CM化，并于“SundayCM剧场”中放映，2014年8月18日还随第12卷限定版同捆推出了广播剧CD。2015年1月16日发售的单行本第14卷书腰上则正式发表了“今春TV动画化”的决定。故事的主人公——热爱漫画、动画、游戏的御宅族青年鉴纯一郎是一名在17岁时就于科学杂志上发表了论文的年轻天才、但在大学毕业后却热衷于更动画博客的啃老族青年。他在妹妹纯音的催促之下勉强开始工作，之后于理事长柊历所率领的柊学园的分校银杏学园里工作。就这样，主要描写了纯一郎以破天荒的授课内容教导并拯救烦恼的学生们的教育剧正式拉开帷幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/86QEXZViHi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tzT4QrjyJp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r2fS25fLvU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iFjq28ppbE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0gALMWzfxK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J1dvz68dQC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jf5jyJDwME1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M2NuS8cfTf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TQ8WSm2vrX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JB7W4PnESb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ai8yt5KCUY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gJ3dt7HDE41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uG4101PWEi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xCp9xTPhd21/video/